    <bpmn:process id="W_W2461" name="W2461. Vendor KPI Benchmarking &amp; Industry Comparison" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual benchmarking exercise
Frequency: Annual; top 50 strategic vendors
Volume: ~50 vendors benchmarked/year
Owner: Procurement Manager
Participants: Procurement Mgr, Category Mgrs, VP Supply Chain
Source: workflow W2461 — Vendor KPI Benchmarking &amp; Industry Comparison</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2461_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W2461_Lane1" name="Procurement Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2461_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2461_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2461_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2461_End6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W2461_Start3" name="Annual benchmarking exercise">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2461_Flow9</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2461_Task4" name="Benchmarks the top 50 strategic vendors&#x27; KPIs against industry standards…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Benchmarks the top 50 strategic vendors&#x27; KPIs against industry standards (retail-supplier benchmarks from a third-party service or a peer-retailer consortium) and BuildRight&#x27;s own peer-group medians; identifies below-industry performers whose BuildRight score may look acceptable but is poor relative to market
Responsible (R): Procurement Manager
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: 3–5 days/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2461_Flow9</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2461_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2461_Task5" name="Shares anonymized benchmark data with vendors during the annual W2462…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Shares anonymized benchmark data with vendors during the annual W2462 performance review — frames &quot;you are at the 40th percentile of your peer group&quot; as a concrete improvement target rather than an abstract BuildRight expectation
Responsible (R): Procurement Manager / Category Managers
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Absorbed into W2462 reviews</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2461_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2461_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2461_End6" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W2461_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W2461_Annotation7">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-430 (ensure controlled execution — Vendor KPI Definition &amp; Data Collection (PA-67.1).) | - Operational: benchmark dataset approved by Procurement Manager before it feeds the scorecard (prevents an unvetted feed from skewing vendor percentiles)
Owner: Procurement Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W2461_Assoc8" sourceRef="W2461_Annotation7" targetRef="W2461_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W2461_Flow9" sourceRef="W2461_Start3" targetRef="W2461_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W2461_Flow10" sourceRef="W2461_Task4" targetRef="W2461_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W2461_Flow11" sourceRef="W2461_Task5" targetRef="W2461_End6" />
    </bpmn:process>
